function e(t){if(!t||t<=0)return"0 B";const r=["B","KB","MB","GB","TB","PB"];let n=0,o=t;for(;o>=1024&&n<r.length-1;)o/=1024,n+=1;return`${o.toFixed(o>=100||n===0?0:2)} ${r[n]}`}function i(t){if(!t||t<=0)return"0 分";const r=Math.floor(t/86400),n=Math.floor(t%86400/3600),o=Math.floor(t%3600/60);return r>0?`${r} 天 ${n} 小时`:n>0?`${n} 小时 ${o} 分`:`${o} 分`}function f(t){if(!t)return"不限";const r=new Date(t);return Number.isNaN(r.getTime())?"-":r.toLocaleString()}export{i as a,f as b,e as f};
